#: ../../expand_tooluniverse/reference/index.rst:76
#: 4248ae0f46b149838c634862f620521e
msgid ""
"**Tool Lifecycle:** 1. **Registration**: Tools register with the registry"
" 2. **Discovery**: ToolUniverse discovers available tools 3. "
"**Configuration**: Tools load their configuration 4. **Execution**: Tools"
" are called with parameters 5. **Response**: Results are returned to the "
"caller"
msgstr ""
"**工具生命周期：**  \n"
"1. **注册**：工具在注册表中进行注册  \n"
"2. **发现**：ToolUniverse 发现可用的工具  \n"
"3. **配置**：工具加载其配置  \n"
"4. **执行**：工具根据参数被调用  \n"
"5. **响应**：结果返回给调用方"

